# A held step's SEL list, opened over the lock editor (step held + EDIT): SELECT moves its rows (not the lock
# editor's pages), and SEL runs the row picked. With CLEAR LOCKS picked, the step's note stays.
wait 300
turn ALGO 1
expect trk 2
tap SEQ
step 2 1 1 60 100
key w0 down
wait 60
press EDIT
wait 60
tap SEL
wait 60
spin SELECT 2
wait 60
tap SEL
wait 60
expect note 2 1 1 60
release EDIT
key w0 up
# letting the step go closes its list: back on Steps (SELECT turns its page, not the list's rows)
wait 60
key w1 down
wait 60
tap SEL
wait 60
key w1 up
wait 60
spin SELECT 1
wait 60
expect page Bar
